 101:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/debug.c ****      * With non-blocking I/O and examples that just retry immediately,
 102:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/debug.c ****      * the logs would be quickly flooded with WANT_READ, so ignore that.
